WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:12.211
Today is Valentine's Day.

2
00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.760
Lucy gave me a card.

3
00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:20.014
"Happy Valentine's Day!"

4
00:00:20.015 --> 00:00:23.689
Tony gave me a lollipop.

5
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.161
"Be Mine."

6
00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:30.072
Maggie gave me a chocolate bar.

7
00:00:30.073 --> 00:00:33.016
"Best Friends."

8
00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:37.354
Chuck gave me a purple candy.

9
00:00:37.355 --> 00:00:40.165
"You are sweet."

10
00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:44.088
Suzy gave me a red flower.

11
00:00:44.089 --> 00:00:47.071
"Friends Forever."

12
00:00:47.072 --> 00:00:51.670
I gave everyone pink cupcakes.

13
00:00:51.671 --> 00:00:54.738
"Happy Valentine's Day, everybody!"

14
00:00:54.739 --> 00:01:00.018
"I love you!"
